OL,3,AAI in property listings is false
OL,4,Aadvertising, house-hunters say
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperty buyers and renters say the use
OL,7,Fof artificial intelligence (AI) in
OL,8,Flistings appearing on sites like
OL,9,FRightmove is "false advertising" and
OL,10,Fwastes time for all involved.
OL,12,FJessica Otterwell, who is hunting for a
OL,13,Fflat in Brighton, East Sussex, told the
OL,14,FBBC: "It's like if you went to buy a
OL,15,Fcar because the picture was of a
OL,16,Fbrand-new Mercedes and you turned up
OL,17,Fand it was a Skoda with one wheel."
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
