OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAI in property listings is false
OL,4,Aadvertising, house-hunters say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn estate agent in Sussex said it could
OL,7,Fcost up for #50,000 to stage a property
OL,8,Fwith furniture, while another in Surrey
OL,9,Fadded: "Technology should help people,
OL,10,Fnot deceive them."
OL,12,FRightmove, a portal website which pulls
OL,13,Fin listings from other estate agents,
OL,14,Fand does not sell or rent properties
OL,15,Fdirectly, said AI-generated imagery was
OL,16,Fallowed on the site if it was clearly
OL,17,Flabelled.
